5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us approach this selection with wisdom and a spirit of generosity toward the future of our science. I look forward to our deliberation.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to be here! Let's make this fun and find the most amazing project together! I can't wait to see what we discover!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Hello... I'm glad to be here. I hope we can make a fair decision that really helps the research. I'll do my best to contribute.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Let's get straight to the point. We need to make sure the money actually goes toward the science and doesn't get wasted on nonsense. I'm ready to dig into the data.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Takumi. We should be methodical. I believe it is important to ensure the infrastructure supporting these projects is stable before we commit. I look forward to your perspectives.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,True wisdom lies in recognizing that the heart of any great discovery is the people who labor for it. Let us ensure we understand the human capacity available to these projects.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, that sounds like a great idea, Servas! I want to know where the money actually goes and what it buys these days. I'm super curious about the hidden details!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it's important to see if the projects we've funded in the past actually finished what they promised. I'm a bit worried about making the wrong choice again.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, worrying doesn't help. We need to find out why projects get delayed. I want to see where the actual bottlenecks are before we commit this grant.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I believe we must assess the current state of our shared resources. If the facilities are overstretched, even the best proposal will fail. I will focus on the capacity of our shared services.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a joy to see such passion. To ensure the hands are ready for the work, I shall examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'll go with the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers, and the national computing agreement and facility day rates! I want to see how the costs are changing!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look into the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns... I just want to be sure we're being realistic about the outcomes.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the portfolio review of schedule overruns. I need to know exactly what's causing these interruptions and delays.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I will examine the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities, as well as the national repository deposit turnaround. This will help me gauge the current pressure on our shared infrastructure.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,We have each set our paths. May the information we uncover illuminate the best way forward for our community. I wish you all a productive search for the truth.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! I'm all set! I can't wait to see what's hiding in those ledgers and agreements. Good luck everyone, let's find some cool secrets!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope the information is helpful. I'll do my best to analyze it carefully. Good luck to everyone as well.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Stop talking and let's just get to the data. I'm not interested in luck; I'm interested in results. Let's see what these records actually show us.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,"We have a comprehensive plan. By covering staffing, finances, past performance, and infrastructure, we will have a balanced view. I look forward to reviewing the findings with you all.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
